# Training.WorkItems API
# Rider: click the green "Run" gutter icon next to any request to send it.
#
# AUTH SETUP (required before any WorkItems request):
#   1. Run the project and open http://localhost:5057/auth/start in your browser
#   2. Complete the SSO login flow
#   3. Open browser DevTools → Application → Cookies → http://localhost:5057 (not https)
#   4. Copy the value of .AspNetCore.Cookies and paste it below

